{"n":86,"name":"At-Tariq","nameAr":"الطارق","meaning":"The Nightcommer","ayahs":17,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ","en":"By the sky and the night comer","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","tr":"wal-samāi","en":"By the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَٱلطَّارِقِ","tr":"wal-ṭāriqi","en":"and the night comer","root":"طرق","lem":"طارِق"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ","en":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?","w":[{"ar":"وَمَآ","tr":"wamā","en":"And what"},{"ar":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","tr":"adrāka","en":"can make you know","root":"دري","lem":"أَدْرَى"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"ٱلطَّارِقُ","tr":"l-ṭāriqu","en":"the night comer (is)","root":"طرق","lem":"طارِق"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"ٱلنَّجْمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ","en":"It is the piercing star","w":[{"ar":"ٱلنَّجْمُ","tr":"al-najmu","en":"(It is) the star","root":"نجم","lem":"نَجْم"},{"ar":"ٱلثَّاقِبُ","tr":"l-thāqibu","en":"the piercing","root":"ثقب","lem":"ثاقِب"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌ","en":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector.","w":[{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":"Not"},{"ar":"كُلُّ","tr":"kullu","en":"(is) every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"نَفْسٍۢ","tr":"nafsin","en":"soul","root":"نفس","lem":"نَفْس"},{"ar":"لَّمَّا","tr":"lammā","en":"but"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهَا","tr":"ʿalayhā","en":"over it"},{"ar":"حَافِظٌۭ","tr":"ḥāfiẓun","en":"(is) a protector","root":"حفظ","lem":"حافِظ"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","en":"So let man observe from what he was created.","w":[{"ar":"فَلْيَنظُرِ","tr":"falyanẓuri","en":"So let see","root":"نظر","lem":"نَظَرَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","tr":"l-insānu","en":"man","root":"أنس","lem":"إِنسان"},{"ar":"مِمَّ","tr":"mimma","en":"from what"},{"ar":"خُلِقَ","tr":"khuliqa","en":"he is created","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"}]},{"n":6,"juz":30,"ar":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٍ دَافِقٍ","en":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,","w":[{"ar":"خُلِقَ","tr":"khuliqa","en":"He is created","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"مَّآءٍۢ","tr":"māin","en":"a water","root":"موه","lem":"ماء"},{"ar":"دَافِقٍۢ","tr":"dāfiqin","en":"ejected","root":"دفق","lem":"دافِق"}]},{"n":7,"juz":30,"ar":"يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ ٱلصُّلْبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","en":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs.","w":[{"ar":"يَخْرُجُ","tr":"yakhruju","en":"Coming forth","root":"خرج","lem":"خَرَجَ"},{"ar":"مِنۢ","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"بَيْنِ","tr":"bayni","en":"between","root":"بين","lem":"بَيْن"},{"ar":"ٱلصُّلْبِ","tr":"l-ṣul'bi","en":"the backbone","root":"صلب","lem":"صُلْب"},{"ar":"وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","tr":"wal-tarāibi","en":"and the ribs","root":"ترب","lem":"تَرائِب"}]},{"n":8,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٌ","en":"Indeed, He [i.e., Allāh], to return him [to life], is Able.","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","tr":"innahu","en":"Indeed, He"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"to"},{"ar":"رَجْعِهِۦ","tr":"rajʿihi","en":"return him","root":"رجع","lem":"رَجْع"},{"ar":"لَقَادِرٌۭ","tr":"laqādirun","en":"(is) Able","root":"قدر","lem":"قادِر"}]},{"n":9,"juz":30,"ar":"يَوْمَ تُبْلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","en":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,","w":[{"ar":"يَوْمَ","tr":"yawma","en":"(The) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"تُبْلَى","tr":"tub'lā","en":"will be tested","root":"بلو","lem":"بَلَوْ"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","tr":"l-sarāiru","en":"the secrets","root":"سرر","lem":"سَرائِر"}]},{"n":10,"juz":30,"ar":"فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٍ وَلَا نَاصِرٍ","en":"Then he [i.e., man] will have no power or any helper.","w":[{"ar":"فَمَا","tr":"famā","en":"Then not"},{"ar":"لَهُۥ","tr":"lahu","en":"(is) for him"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"any"},{"ar":"قُوَّةٍۢ","tr":"quwwatin","en":"power","root":"قوي","lem":"قُوَّة"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"نَاصِرٍۢ","tr":"nāṣirin","en":"any helper","root":"نصر","lem":"ناصِر"}]},{"n":11,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجْعِ","en":"By the sky which sends back","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","tr":"wal-samāi","en":"By the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"ذَاتِ","tr":"dhāti","en":"which"},{"ar":"ٱلرَّجْعِ","tr":"l-rajʿi","en":"returns","root":"رجع","lem":"رَجْع"}]},{"n":12,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدْعِ","en":"And [by] the earth which splits,","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"wal-arḍi","en":"And the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"ذَاتِ","tr":"dhāti","en":"which"},{"ar":"ٱلصَّدْعِ","tr":"l-ṣadʿi","en":"cracks open","root":"صدع","lem":"صَدْع"}]},{"n":13,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلٌ فَصْلٌ","en":"Indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a decisive statement,","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","tr":"innahu","en":"Indeed, it"},{"ar":"لَقَوْلٌۭ","tr":"laqawlun","en":"(is) surely a Word","root":"قول","lem":"قَوْل"},{"ar":"فَصْلٌۭ","tr":"faṣlun","en":"decisive","root":"فصل","lem":"فَصْل"}]},{"n":14,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلْهَزْلِ","en":"And it is not amusement.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"it"},{"ar":"بِٱلْهَزْلِ","tr":"bil-hazli","en":"(is) for amusement","root":"هزل","lem":"هَزْل"}]},{"n":15,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًا","en":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","tr":"innahum","en":"Indeed, they"},{"ar":"يَكِيدُونَ","tr":"yakīdūna","en":"are plotting","root":"كيد","lem":"كِيدُ"},{"ar":"كَيْدًۭا","tr":"kaydan","en":"a plot","root":"كيد","lem":"كَيْد"}]},{"n":16,"juz":30,"ar":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًا","en":"But I am planning a plan.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَكِيدُ","tr":"wa-akīdu","en":"But I am planning","root":"كيد","lem":"كِيدُ"},{"ar":"كَيْدًۭا","tr":"kaydan","en":"a plan","root":"كيد","lem":"كَيْد"}]},{"n":17,"juz":30,"ar":"فَمَهِّلِ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدًۢا","en":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile.","w":[{"ar":"فَمَهِّلِ","tr":"famahhili","en":"So give respite","root":"مهل","lem":"مَهِّلِ"},{"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","tr":"l-kāfirīna","en":"(to) the disbelievers","root":"كفر","lem":"كافِر"},{"ar":"أَمْهِلْهُمْ","tr":"amhil'hum","en":"Give respite to them ","root":"مهل","lem":"أَمْهِلْ"},{"ar":"رُوَيْدًۢا","tr":"ruwaydan","en":"little","root":"رود","lem":"رُوَيْد"}]}]}